[38;2;124;124;124mroots of unity (with $\zeta_{mn}^m = \zeta_n$), the isomorphism $[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m\widehat{\mathbb{Z}} \xrightarrow{\sim} T(\mu_\infty)$ sends $(a_n) \in [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m\widehat{\mathbb{Z}}$ to $(\zeta_n^{a_n})$. For $\sigma \in G_\mathbb{Q}$, we [0m
